OL,3,GNEWSAClare's Law 'failure' over woman's
OL,4,Amurder - coroner
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who was murdered by her
OL,7,Fex-partner had asked police for
OL,8,Finformation about him under Clare's Law
OL,9,Fbut the force failed to share it, a
OL,10,Fcoroner said.
OL,12,FMatthew Waddell was jailed in 2023 for
OL,13,Fmurdering Sarah Albone, 38, and hiding
OL,14,Fher body in a wheelie bin at her home
OL,15,Fin Biggleswade, Bedfordshire.
OL,17,FClare's Law - also called the Domestic
OL,18,FViolence Disclosure Scheme (DVDS) -
OL,19,Fallows people to find out if a partner
OL,20,Fhas a history of abusive or violent
OL,21,Fbehaviour.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
