OL,3,GNEWSAClare's Law 'failure' over woman's
OL,4,Amurder - coroner
OL,5,
OL,6,FBedfordshire Police previously accepted
OL,7,Fit "should have done more to protect
OL,8,FSarah", but said its use of Clare's Law
OL,9,F"was consistent with the statutory
OL,10,Fguidance in force at the relevant
OL,11,Ftime".
